  "notes": [
    "Sunset Coral (#f36c5c) is 2.95:1 on white: decorative or large-area use only on light backgrounds. Use step 600 for text.",
    "Tide Blue (#9ec8e7) is 1.77:1 on white: decorative or large-area use only on light backgrounds. Use step 600 for text.",
